#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/online_food_delivery.rst:198
msgid ""
"Clicking this icon displays the number of orders at each stage: "
":guilabel:`New`, :guilabel:`Ongoing`, and :guilabel:`Done`."
msgstr ""
"Кликването върху тази икона показва броя на поръчките на всеки етап: "
":guilabel:`New`, :guilabel:`Ongoing` и :guilabel:`Done`."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/online_food_delivery.rst:200
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`New` button indicates newly placed orders, "
":guilabel:`Ongoing` is for accepted orders, and :guilabel:`Done` is for "
"orders ready to be delivered."
msgstr ""
"Бутонът :guilabel:`New` показва новопостъпилите поръчки, :guilabel:`Ongoing`"
" е за приетите поръчки, а :guilabel:`Done` е за поръчките, готови за "
"доставка."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/online_food_delivery.rst:203
msgid "Then,"
msgstr "След това,"

#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/online_food_delivery.rst:205
#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/online_food_delivery.rst:224
msgid "Select the desired order."
msgstr "Изберете желаната поръчка."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/online_food_delivery.rst:206
msgid "Click the :guilabel:`Accept` button."
msgstr "Кликнете върху бутона :guilabel:`Accept`."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/online_food_delivery.rst:207
msgid ""
"When an order is accepted, its :guilabel:`Order Status` switches from "
":guilabel:`Placed` to :guilabel:`Acknowledged` and is automatically "
"displayed on the preparation display."
msgstr ""
"Когато една поръчка бъде приета, нейният :guilabel:`Order Status` преминава "
"от :guilabel:`Placed` към :guilabel:`Acknowledged` и се показва автоматично "
"на дисплея за приготвяне."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/online_food_delivery.rst:210
msgid "When the order is ready,"
msgstr "Когато поръчката е готова,"

#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/online_food_delivery.rst:212
msgid "Open the orders' list view."
msgstr "Отворете списъчния изглед на поръчките."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/online_food_delivery.rst:213
msgid "Select the order."
msgstr "Изберете поръчката."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/online_food_delivery.rst:214
msgid ""
"Click the :guilabel:`Mark as ready` button. Its :guilabel:`Order Status` "
"switches from :guilabel:`Acknowledged` to :guilabel:`Food Ready`, and its "
":guilabel:`Status` switches from :guilabel:`Ongoing` to :guilabel:`Paid`."
msgstr ""
"Кликнете върху бутона :guilabel:`Mark as ready`. Нейният :guilabel:`Order "
"Status` преминава от :guilabel:`Acknowledged` към :guilabel:`Food Ready`, а "
"нейният :guilabel:`Status` преминава от :guilabel:`Ongoing` към "
":guilabel:`Paid`."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/online_food_delivery.rst:219
msgid "Order rejection"
msgstr "Отхвърляне на поръчка"

#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/online_food_delivery.rst:221
msgid ""
"Sometimes, the shop or restaurant may want to **reject** an order. In this "
"case, open the orders' list view,"
msgstr ""
"Понякога магазинът или ресторантът може да иска да **отхвърли** поръчка. В "
"този случай отворете списъчния изглед на поръчките,"

#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/online_food_delivery.rst:225
msgid "Click the :guilabel:`Reject` button."
msgstr "Кликнете върху бутона :guilabel:`Отхвърляне`."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/online_food_delivery.rst:226
msgid "Select one of the reasons from the popup window."
msgstr "Изберете една от причините от изскачащия прозорец."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/online_food_delivery.rst:None
msgid "Reject order pop-up"
msgstr "Изскачащ прозорец за отхвърляне на поръчка"

#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/online_food_delivery.rst:232
msgid ""
"**Swiggy** orders cannot be directly rejected. Attempting to reject one "
"prompts Swiggy customer support to contact the restaurant. Similarly, "
"**Deliveroo**, **JustEat**, and **HungerStation** do not allow order "
"rejection. Always follow the respective provider's guidelines for handling "
"such cases."
msgstr ""
"Поръчките от **Swiggy** не могат да бъдат отхвърляни директно. Опитът за "
"отхвърляне подканва екипа за поддръжка на клиенти на Swiggy да се свърже с "
"ресторанта. По подобен начин **Deliveroo**, **JustEat** и **HungerStation** "
"не позволяват отхвърляне на поръчка. Винаги следвайте съответните насоки на "
"доставчика за подобни случаи."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/payment_methods.rst:5
msgid "Payment methods"
msgstr "Начини на плащане"

#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/payment_methods.rst:7
msgid ""
"To add a payment method, you first need to create it. Go to "
":menuselection:`Point of Sale --> Configuration --> Payment Methods --> "
"New`, and set a name. Check :guilabel:`Identify Customer` to allow this "
"payment method *exclusively* for registered customers."
msgstr ""
"За да добавите метод на плащане, първо трябва да го създадете. Отидете на "
":menuselection:`Point of Sale --> Configuration --> Payment Methods --> "
"New`, и задайте име. Поставете отметка на :guilabel:`Identify Customer`, за "
"да позволите този метод на плащане *единствено* за регистрирани клиенти."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/payment_methods.rst:11
msgid ""
"Then, select the :guilabel:`Journal`. Choose :guilabel:`Cash` to use this "
"payment method for cash payments, or :guilabel:`Bank` to use it for card "
"payments."
msgstr ""
"След това изберете :guilabel:`Journal`. Изберете :guilabel:`Cash`, за да "
"използвате този метод на плащане за плащания в брой, или :guilabel:`Bank`, "
"за да го използвате за плащания с карта."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/payment_methods.rst:None
msgid "Creating a new payment method for a POS."
msgstr "Създаване на нов метод на плащане за ПОС."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/payment_methods.rst:18
msgid ""
"Selecting a :guilabel:`bank` journal automatically adds the :guilabel:`Use a"
" Payment Terminal` field in which you can add your :doc:`payment terminal's "
"information <payment_methods/terminals>`."
msgstr ""
"Избирането на дневник :guilabel:`bank` автоматично добавя полето "
":guilabel:`Use a Payment Terminal`, в което можете да добавите "
":doc:`информацията за вашия терминал за плащане "
"<payment_methods/terminals>`."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/payment_methods.rst:23
msgid ":doc:`payment_methods/terminals`."
msgstr ":doc:`payment_methods/terminals`."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/payment_methods.rst:25
#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/payment_methods/terminals/adyen.rst:84
#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/payment_methods/terminals/ingenico.rst:51
msgid ""
"Once the payment method is created, you can select it in your POS settings. "
"To do so, go to the :ref:`POS' settings <configuration/settings>`, click "
":guilabel:`Edit`, and add the payment method under the :guilabel:`Payments` "
"section."
msgstr ""
"След като методът на плащане бъде създаден, можете да го изберете в "
"настройките на вашата ПОС. За да направите това, отидете на "
":ref:`настройките на ПОС <configuration/settings>`, щракнете върху "
":guilabel:`Edit`, и добавете метода на плащане в раздела "
":guilabel:`Payments`."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/payment_methods/qr_code_payment.rst:3
msgid "QR code payments"
msgstr "Плащания с QR код"

#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/payment_methods/qr_code_payment.rst:5
msgid ""
"QR code payments allow users to generate a code that customers can scan with"
" their mobile banking app to initiate a bank transfer or pay instantly."
msgstr ""
"Плащанията с QR код позволяват на потребителите да генерират код, който "
"клиентите могат да сканират с мобилното си банково приложение, за да "
"инициират банков превод или да платят незабавно."

