#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/payment_methods/terminals/worldline.rst:5
msgid ""
"`Worldline <https://worldline.com/>`_ offers payment solutions through "
":doc:`payment terminals <../terminals>` to handle customer transactions."
